        "TileImage": "$($repository 05242eed-a950-449e-8765-b3a1fcfad4df).Image",
        "Description": "Greetings Agent,\r\rA contract has been placed by Radical Rap Records for one of their up-and-coming hip-hop artists Dyson Ortega, better known by his stage name, Lil Son.\r\rMr. Ortega has made the mistake of sponsoring talent outside of his community thanks to the influence of his girlfriend, Dorita Sinclair. The label feels that Mr. Ortega is diluting the industry; and so, must be terminated along with the prospective talent as well as his impressionable girlfriend.\r\rHappy hunting, Agent.",
